?><!doctype html><html><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Goliath Distribution Queue</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/dashboard/assets/goliath-v33.css?v=33"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/dashboard/assets/goliath-v45-final.css?v=457"><style>.distGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.distTile,.queueRow{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);padding:14px}.queueList{display:grid;gap:10px}.queueRow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 130px 100px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start}.queueRow p{margin:.25rem 0;color:#bfc8d6}.badge{display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}@media(max-width:900px){.distGrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.queueRow{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.distGrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><div class="shell"><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/goliath-sidebar-v33.php'; ?><main class="main"><section class="top"><div><h1>Goliath Distribution Queue</h1><p>Your in-house Blotato-style layer: every lead becomes private follow-up plus public-safe content for email, blog, social, video and ads.</p></div><div class="brandbar"><a class="btn dark" href="/dashboard/goliath-mission-control.php">Mission Control</a><a class="btn" href="/lead-engine/goliath-content-cycle.php?key=<?=h($key)?>" target="_blank">Test Content Cycle</a></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>Platform Queue <span>client-specific content repurposing</span></h2><div class="inner"><div class="distGrid"><?php foreach(['email_followup'=>'Email','blog_article'=>'Blog','facebook'=>'Facebook','instagram'=>'Instagram','linkedin'=>'LinkedIn','tiktok'=>'TikTok','youtube_shorts'=>'YouTube Shorts','google_business_profile'=>'Google Business'] as $k=>$label):?><div class="distTile"><strong><?=h($label)?></strong><p><?=h($platformStats[$k]??0)?> queued/active</p><small>Private info is stripped before public posting.</small></div><?php endforeach;?></div></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>Latest Lead Content Cycles <span><?=count($rows)?> items</span></h2><div class="inner"><div class="queueList"><?php if(!$rows):?><p>No distribution tasks yet. Submit a buyer/seller/valuation form or run the test content cycle.</p><?php endif;?><?php foreach(array_slice($rows,0,80) as $r):?><div class="queueRow"><div><strong><?=h(str_replace('_',' ',$r['platform']))?></strong><p><?=h($r['created_at']?date('m/d h:i A',strtotime($r['created_at'])):'')?></p></div><div><span class="badge"><?=h($r['status'])?></span><p><?=h($r['persona'])?></p></div><div><?=h($r['lead']?:'Lead')?></div><div><strong><?=h($r['topic']?:'Client-specific content')?></strong><p><?=h(mb_strimwidth($r['prompt'],0,220,'...'))?></p></div></div><?php endforeach;?></div></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>What still needs real API credentials?</h2><div class="inner"><p>This patch creates the Blotato-style queue inside Goliath. Auto-posting to Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok, YouTube and Google Business requires platform API keys or a Make/Zapier/n8n bridge. Until those keys are connected, Goliath queues, writes, prepares and tracks the assets, but does not publish them blindly.</p></div></section></main></div></body></html>
